<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>口语练习 on 编程那些事儿</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E5%8F%A3%E8%AF%AD%E7%BB%83%E4%B9%A0/</link><description>Recent content in 口语练习 on 编程那些事儿</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:31:03 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E5%8F%A3%E8%AF%AD%E7%BB%83%E4%B9%A0/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>语言考试备考</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/study/toefl-ielts-prep/</link><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/study/toefl-ielts-prep/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;托福雅思这件事，中国学生最典型的困境不是不努力，是&lt;strong&gt;练错了方向&lt;/strong&gt;：阅读听力刷到满分，口语写作卡在 23 分不动。原因是&lt;strong&gt;输入能力可以靠刷题，输出能力必须靠人&lt;/strong&gt;——你得真的开口，还得有人告诉你哪里不对。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>